<bold>a</bold> with and without DDMC, for amplitudes of 0, 10, 20, and 30&#x000a0;mm for TBR 5, with the target spheres on the x-axis. The results with amplitude of 7&#x000a0;mm are omitted from this figure to increase readability. Ratio of <inline-formula id="IEq79"><alternatives><tex-math id="d33e1214">\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
